    {
      "id": "d4Ea56aNl9Is1mwkcWxkV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 449.2271015689663,
      "y": 797.8487248614788,
      "width": 825.1194458007812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 260079697,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 722804998,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785158338454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Spark build its queries computation as Direct Acyclic Graph (DAG)\n        - DAG schedular and Query optimizer (Tungsten Execution Engine)\n- In-memory processing and limited disk I/O  \n- Maximize the hardware utilization through multi-threading and parallel processing   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Spark build its queries computation as Direct Acyclic Graph (DAG)\n        - DAG schedular and Query optimizer (Tungsten Execution Engine)\n- In-memory processing and limited disk I/O  \n- Maximize the hardware utilization through multi-threading and parallel processing   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bGGqYTlql9N13M3j7ZQ6s",
