      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784976713496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Spark focus on its fast, parallel processing. Unlike hadoop (MapReduce, HDFS) \n- Saprk's DataFrameReaders and DataFrameWriters allows interactions with multiple data sources \n- The spark community maintain a third-party packages, enhancing its ecosystem ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Spark focus on its fast, parallel processing. Unlike hadoop (MapReduce, HDFS) \n- Saprk's DataFrameReaders and DataFrameWriters allows interactions with multiple data sources \n- The spark community maintain a third-party packages, enhancing its ecosystem ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
