      "seed": 2002833798,
      "version": 638,
      "versionNonce": 1196232026,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785164144287,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- It transform all the spark operations into DAG computations, schedule them, \n    and distribute to the executors.\n- Control the application execution.\n- It acts as a process on physical machine, responsible for the overall state of the spark application.\n- It instantiates the SparkSession\n- It requests resources (CPU, Memory) from the cluster manager.\n- Once the resources are allocated using the spark session, it communicates with the executors. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- It transform all the spark operations into DAG computations, schedule them, \n    and distribute to the executors.\n- Control the application execution.\n- It acts as a process on physical machine, responsible for the overall state of the spark application.\n- It instantiates the SparkSession\n- It requests resources (CPU, Memory) from the cluster manager.\n- Once the resources are allocated using the spark session, it communicates with the executors. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
