      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785258960253,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The spark driver process begins running user code that include the spark Session.\n- The spark session subsequently communicates with the cluster manager to launch Spark \n    executor processes across the cluster.\n- The cluster manager responds by launching the executor processes.(Assuming all goes well)\n- As a result we get a \"Spark Cluster\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The spark driver process begins running user code that include the spark Session.\n- The spark session subsequently communicates with the cluster manager to launch Spark \n    executor processes across the cluster.\n- The cluster manager responds by launching the executor processes.(Assuming all goes well)\n- As a result we get a \"Spark Cluster\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
