      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785324173690,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- In general, there should be one spark job for one action\n- Each jobs breaks down into a series of stages.\n- The number of stages depends on how many shuffle operations need to take place\n- Application  1:*  action  1:1   job   1:*   stage   1:*   tasks  1:1   partition",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- In general, there should be one spark job for one action\n- Each jobs breaks down into a series of stages.\n- The number of stages depends on how many shuffle operations need to take place\n- Application  1:*  action  1:1   job   1:*   stage   1:*   tasks  1:1   partition",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
