      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Spark automatically pipelines tasks that can be done together\n- For all shuffle operations, Spark writes the data to stable storage (data)\n    so it can reuse it across multiple jobs.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Spark automatically pipelines tasks that can be done together\n- For all shuffle operations, Spark writes the data to stable storage (data)\n    so it can reuse it across multiple jobs.",
