      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785755825025,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Spark packs and pipelines that sequence of operations that feed data to \neach-other directly without moving data across nodes (map -> filter -> map ) into one stage of tasks.\n- this pipelined version of computations is much faster that writing the \n    intermediate results to memory of disk.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Spark packs and pipelines that sequence of operations that feed data to \neach-other directly without moving data across nodes (map -> filter -> map ) into one stage of tasks.\n- this pipelined version of computations is much faster that writing the \n    intermediate results to memory of disk.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
