      "text": "- Efficient parallelism : it allows executors process data partitions close to them \n- Dedicated processing : each core on an executor works on its own partition,\n    minimizing network bandwidth usage",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Efficient parallelism : it allows executors process data partitions close to them \n- Dedicated processing : each core on an executor works on its own partition,\n    minimizing network bandwidth usage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GrL2vM5nrCSnk8_9Sidbd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 502.6274238903196,
      "y": 11961.170059580438,
      "width": 898.619384765625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1739629923,
      "version": 400,
      "versionNonce": 1459990691,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785757709684,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- operations types : transformation and actions \n- Spark operations are immutable \n- When spark apply a transformation on an RDD, DF or DS, the original data never changes.\n    => this helps in fault tolerance through the lineage, Parallelism and lazy evaluation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- operations types : transformation and actions \n- Spark operations are immutable \n- When spark apply a transformation on an RDD, DF or DS, the original data never changes.\n    => this helps in fault tolerance through the lineage, Parallelism and lazy evaluation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QoCbpkdojeGseaKMVS2af",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 524.7725608950468,
      "y": 12124.20561363877,
      "width": 818.7994384765625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1701019981,
      "version": 227,
      "versionNonce": 1550785475,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785757702119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- it transform a dataframe into a new dataframe without altering the original data.\n- Example : map(), filter(), filter(), drop()",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- it transform a dataframe into a new dataframe without altering the original data.\n- Example : map(), filter(), filter(), drop()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bU-UeIHGXpjyVsl3ElPwC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540.0030393350024,
      "y": 12266.928993069763,
      "width": 623.99951171875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 899793325,
      "version": 270,
      "versionNonce": 227532323,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785758356468,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- In spark, transformations are lazy.\n- Computation are not executed immediately\n- Spark builds a DAG (Direct Acyclic Graph) of transformations.\n- All transformations are recorded as lineage.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- In spark, transformations are lazy.\n- Computation are not executed immediately\n- Spark builds a DAG (Direct Acyclic Graph) of transformations.\n- All transformations are recorded as lineage.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RdfmX5ARvddX80uSVSOGo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 538.4871862122112,
      "y": 12469.868479949018,
      "width": 900.8993530273438,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 637713635,
      "version": 404,
      "versionNonce": 641392973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785758568555,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Optimization : the DAG allows spark to rearrange certain transformations, coalesce them  \nfor more efficient execution.\n- Resource Management : Execute tasks efficiently using fewer resources.\n- Fault tolerance : in case of a part fails, spark could rebuild it using the lineage.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Optimization : the DAG allows spark to rearrange certain transformations, coalesce them  \nfor more efficient execution.\n- Resource Management : Execute tasks efficiently using fewer resources.\n- Fault tolerance : in case of a part fails, spark could rebuild it using the lineage.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8Ps374luEAqBhmBn7-t_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 524.0563030218359,
      "y": 12650.950193923723,
      "width": 961.5593872070312,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 306879779,
      "version": 302,
      "versionNonce": 370056909,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785760129446,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- An action is the operation that triggers all the recorded transformations.\n- Move back the result of transformations from the spark app executors to the spark app driver. \n- Examples : collect, count, saveAsTextFile, take(n)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- An action is the operation that triggers all the recorded transformations.\n- Move back the result of transformations from the spark app executors to the spark app driver. \n- Examples : collect, count, saveAsTextFile, take(n)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5twPYHx1RAiyEfVbhmkSO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 484.79554501764864,
